# A subclass declared in the consuming package inherits its `implements`
# conformance from an imported base. The consumer has no adapter for the
# parent's methods (adapters are neither imported nor exported), so it must
# emit its own — and `Kid` declares no methods at all, which also exercises the
# "no local class methods" gate on the closure machinery.
# name          dir    deps          root
@test/base      base   -
main            app    @test/base    root
